cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this bind, cite Thiery, Michel and Chen, whose biharmonic coordinates it computes.
title: bhc13 -- the (1,3) biharmonic cage bind, deform and Jacobian (RFD 2279's shared deform surface)
abstract: >-
  net_from_mesh, bind(net, mesh, "bhc13"), weights, deform and jacobian
  drive the Lean-emitted kernels in kernels/cage (see its CITATION.cff) for
  the (1,3) biharmonic coordinates of src/BHC.h of
  V-Sekai-fire/interactor-tool-godot-cage-deformer. The host code here
  (net checks, the stepped BindJob, the normal pull-back) is written here;
  no BHC.h source is copied. Checked against the native BHC.h oracle
  (gates/9-cage, G1) and tests/cage_oracle.
type: software
